+// vkquake-ios overlay 0018 — first-person VR (docs/VR-CHARTER.md R1).
+//
+// The 3D panel (0010) lets the compositor free-run and sample whatever the
+// engine last rendered. VR cannot: the pose the engine RENDERS with must be the
+// pose the compositor REPROJECTS against, or the world shakes with head sway
+// (charter A4, trap ledger). So the two loops rendezvous once per compositor
+// frame:
+//
+//   compositor: query drawable -> device anchor at PRESENTATION time -> compose
+//               both eyes' view+projection -> VKQ_VR_PublishPose() (id N)
+//   engine:     SCR_UpdateScreen -> VKQ_VR_EngineAcquire() blocks for id > last
+//               -> renders L then R with EXACTLY those matrices
